+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+//
+// Kiln OS: Settings > System > Reset root password and the factory reset's
+// root password. HelixScreen asks Kiln's root update agent through files in
+// /run/ad5x/screen-request (S68ad5x-update-agent, screen_password_request):
+// root-password-default with "reset" or "factory-reset", answered in
+// root-password-default.status; root-password-reset.state says whether the
+// owner locked the button over SSH. Here a folder of the test's own stands in
+// for it, and the test writes the agent's answers.
+
